WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:02.989
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> Prefixes and suffixes

00:00:03.445 --> 00:00:04.125
1

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:05.852
Prefixes

00:00:06.937 --> 00:00:07.660
1

00:00:08.796 --> 00:00:15.966
<v><b>M:</b></v> a / an means ‘without’: amoral, anaemic

00:00:17.702 --> 00:00:18.423
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:19.489 --> 00:00:23.656
<v><b>F:</b></v> ante means ‘before’: antenatal

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:26.333
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:27.234 --> 00:00:31.228
<v><b>M:</b></v> circum means ‘around’: circumnavigate

00:00:32.897 --> 00:00:33.676
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:34.829 --> 00:00:42.929
<v><b>F:</b></v> contra / contro means ‘against’: contradict, controversial

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:44.634
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:45.595 --> 00:00:51.188
<v><b>M:</b></v> extra means ’beyond’, ‘more than’: extraordinary

00:00:52.979 --> 00:00:53.862
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:54.798 --> 00:00:59.366
<v><b>F:</b></v> fore means ‘before’: foresee

00:01:01.177 --> 00:01:01.999
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:01:03.105 --> 00:01:07.296
<v><b>M:</b></v> homo means ‘the same’: homogenous

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:09.931
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:01:10.859 --> 00:01:16.173
<v><b>F:</b></v> hyper means ‘over’, ‘above’: hyperactive

00:01:17.977 --> 00:01:18.822
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 9

00:01:19.820 --> 00:01:25.101
<v><b>M:</b></v> infra means ‘beneath’, ‘below’: infrastructure

00:01:26.921 --> 00:01:27.690
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 10

00:01:28.675 --> 00:01:34.110
<v><b>F:</b></v> macro means ‘large’: macroeconomics

00:01:35.963 --> 00:01:36.803
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 11

00:01:37.855 --> 00:01:42.337
<v><b>M:</b></v> micro means ‘small’: microscope

00:01:44.128 --> 00:01:45.044
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 12

00:01:46.013 --> 00:01:51.278
<v><b>F:</b></v> omni means ‘all’, ‘every’: omnipotent

00:01:53.106 --> 00:01:54.079
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 13

00:01:55.144 --> 00:01:59.196
<v><b>M:</b></v> para means ‘beside’: paramedic

00:02:00.902 --> 00:02:01.906
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 14

00:02:03.041 --> 00:02:07.805
<v><b>F:</b></v> trans means ‘across’: transatlantic

00:02:09.627 --> 00:02:10.641
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 15

00:02:11.772 --> 00:02:16.062
<v><b>M:</b></v> uni means ‘one’: unicorn